+  | Environment value | Conflicting variable |
+  | --- | --- |
+  | `K6_VUS=1` | `K6_VUS` |
+  | `K6_ITERATIONS=0` | `K6_ITERATIONS` |
+  | `K6_DURATION=2s` | `K6_DURATION` |
